          "id": 1402988129,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Not enthusiastic about this change, now there's two places to maintain 3rd party blobs; `win-setup.ps1` and `packaging/nsis/CMakeLists.txt`.\n\nIMO we should stick with one place.",
