        {
          "id": 1403362365,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I would suggest keeping the management of 3rd party blobs in a single place.\n\nPrior to this change that was all handled in win-setup.ps1, now it's not.\n\nI must be missing something, I can't see how this fixes any existing issue or improves things so why make the change at all?",
