        {
          "id": 1403391822,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "These two exe files are required to build a Windows installer using MSYS2. The 3rd party libraries are not so we don't run the win-setup.ps1 script in that case, which would download extraneous files to the build.",
